# UI-Markdown (UMD) Specification

Unified document model combining fluid Markdown writing with reactive UI blocks.

## 1. Core Principles

- **Zero Companion Files**: Stored entirely in plain text with the `.umd` extension.
- **Notion-Like Fluidity**: Free typing anywhere, instant keyboard block creation.
- **Full Bi-directional Editing**: AST-backed parser guarantees lossless roundtrip preservation.

[TABLE title="Supported Components"]
Component | Syntax | Output
Table | [TABLE title="..."] | Interactive table with dynamic rows/columns
Callout | [CALLOUT tone="..."] | Tinted alert card with icon and body
Stat Cards | [COLUMNS] [CARD] | Responsive multi-column metric boxes
Task Checklist | - [ ] Task name | Interactive checkbox with strike-through
Toggle List | <details> <summary> | Collapsible accordion dropdown
[/TABLE]

[CALLOUT tone="success" title="Production Ready"]
The core parser and VS Code extension are published under the MIT license.
[/CALLOUT]

> "Write like Markdown. Experience like Notion. Store like pure text."
